{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/993998-strech-goal-delivery-dates","id":993998,"title":"Strech Goal delivery dates","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-27T05:36:29-07:00","id":993998,"title":"Strech Goal delivery dates","content":"M20 Core rulebook arrived on my doorstep just days before hitting two years (Kickstarter ended in April 2014). It is now 6 months after its arrival (which was a full year late) and practically none of the stretch goals have been delivered. I've also seen practically zero communication on this front from Rich and team. Asking me to look at the monday morning meeting notes for project updates does not address my concerns. I paid for a product, it was meant to come with additional products as stretch goals. It still hasn't. What is a real date on when we can expect any of the outstanding items?<br /> <br /> Not having these products has severely inconvenienced my group to the point of disinterest in the M20 product line. It has forced me, a person who up to M20 had backed every 20th edition project at the Deluxe levels, to re-evaluate where my money is going. I haven't purchased a product since. I'll continue to not purchase products until Onyx can prove to me that they will deliver on their promises in a timely, communicative, and professional way. At the end of the day, I love what Onyx delivers, the wait and lack of updates is what is killing any remaining hope that I will ever see the products that were paid for.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11622-cynn78","name":"cynn78","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T06:00:20-07:00","id":994003,"title":"","content":"Well, at least you can see whenever the status changes in the Monday Meeting notes..<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Book Of Secrets</i>&quot; has passed writing and editing, and is now in art direction. So, essentially, Phil has written all the text, it has gone through first editing, and now artworks are being made and inserted.<br /> <br /> After that there should be post-dev editing/proofing of the whole shebang. So basically, it's more or less in the last steps.<br /> <br /> M20 <i>&quot;Gods and Monsters&quot;</i>, <i>&quot;Book Of the Fallen&quot;</i> and the <i>&quot;CookBook&quot;</i> are all in the First Draft stage - as in, Phil and Co are actively writing content, still, without any editing or art done yet.<br /> <br /> <br /> I agree that this isn't any kind of list of fixed dates, and RichT might need a prod or two to send out one of his semi-monthly Kickstarter Mails describing the current status and date predictions for things like the Book of Secrets, or updates by the authors.<br /> <br /> He did that for Vampire and Werewolf, and Wraith also gets the occasional status update mails.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> Also, <i>&quot;How Do you Do That?&quot;</i> was a stretch goal <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And it's been out for a few months.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":6606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","user":"Ambrosia","date":". 10-27-2016, 09:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T07:24:19-07:00","id":994019,"title":"","content":"My understanding is that it's taking a long time because Satyros Brucato is both the developer and the main writer. I don't think very many of the other projects have one single bottleneck like that. I'm not sure it's a bad thing, but it's probably why things are so slow going on M20 stretch goals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T07:48:03-07:00","id":994023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/993998-strech-goal-delivery-dates?p=994003#post994003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, at least you can see whenever the status changes in the Monday Meeting notes..<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Book Of Secrets</i>&quot; has passed writing and editing, and is now in art direction. So, essentially, Phil has written all the text, it has gone through first editing, and now artworks are being made and inserted.<br /> <br /> After that there should be post-dev editing/proofing of the whole shebang. So basically, it's more or less in the last steps.<br /> <br /> M20 <i>&quot;Gods and Monsters&quot;</i>, <i>&quot;Book Of the Fallen&quot;</i> and the <i>&quot;CookBook&quot;</i> are all in the First Draft stage - as in, Phil and Co are actively writing content, still, without any editing or art done yet.<br /> <br /> <br /> I agree that this isn't any kind of list of fixed dates, and RichT might need a prod or two to send out one of his semi-monthly Kickstarter Mails describing the current status and date predictions for things like the Book of Secrets, or updates by the authors.<br /> <br /> He did that for Vampire and Werewolf, and Wraith also gets the occasional status update mails.<br /> <br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> Also, <i>&quot;How Do you Do That?&quot;</i> was a stretch goal <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And it's been out for a few months.</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolutely true in terms of what projects are where. Also, in general, Kickstarters where we are still working on the KS'd project, the one we did the KS for, all get monthly or more Backer Updates via KS. KSs where the main project was delivered get Backer Updates when something new needs to be made known to the backers. I've informed every backer in multiple Backer Updates that the weekly Monday Meeting Notes blog progress updates exist and that they can have the MMN blog emailed to them every week by joining our Onyx Path mailing List, if they need more frequent word on any Stretch Goal progress.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T08:05:15-07:00","id":994027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cynn78</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/993998-strech-goal-delivery-dates#post993998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">M20 Core rulebook arrived on my doorstep just days before hitting two years (Kickstarter ended in April 2014). It is now 6 months after its arrival (which was a full year late) and practically none of the stretch goals have been delivered. I've also seen practically zero communication on this front from Rich and team. Asking me to look at the monday morning meeting notes for project updates does not address my concerns. I paid for a product, it was meant to come with additional products as stretch goals. It still hasn't. What is a real date on when we can expect any of the outstanding items?<br /> <br /> Not having these products has severely inconvenienced my group to the point of disinterest in the M20 product line. It has forced me, a person who up to M20 had backed every 20th edition project at the Deluxe levels, to re-evaluate where my money is going. I haven't purchased a product since. I'll continue to not purchase products until Onyx can prove to me that they will deliver on their promises in a timely, communicative, and professional way. At the end of the day, I love what Onyx delivers, the wait and lack of updates is what is killing any remaining hope that I will ever see the products that were paid for.</div> </div> </div> </div>According to my count, only the M20 Art Book and the Technocracy Reloaded Stretch Goals are not currently being written, and Book of Secrets, Gods, Monsters, and Other Familiar Strangers (the character packs), Book of the Fallen, and the M20 Cookbook are all at various stages of creation as per the post after yours and the Monday Meeting Notes blog progress report. We have delivered every other M20 KS Stretch Goal, including the M20 Quickstart, M20 How Do You DO That?, and the Truth Beyond Paradox fiction anthology already.<br /> <br /> Sounds like a robust roll out for M20, so while I understand that you'd like more, faster (I mean, who doesn't want that from the things they enjoy?), I really don't understand why you feel you've been treated poorly. You had the opportunity to read through Satyr Phil's reports and my Updates during the massive undertaking that was M20, so you know that we couldn't have just dived into all these additional Stretch Goal projects while he was actively working on M20 itself, and Book of Secrets is also a really big book - as he and I both have noted many times. There almost none of these projects that he can do concurrently with other projects.<br /> <br /> M20 was later than anyone wanted, no argument there, but we have never, NEVER, given backers dates (or even estimated dates like we are forced to by Kickstarter for M20 itself) for delivering Stretch Goals. They will be done as we finish them to our standards of quality; we never even suggested otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}